From d4592f4055c7b0ed2e765a1780dbf665eb3d9af1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: patch <claude@localhost>
Date: Fri, 24 Apr 2026 10:41:07 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Mandoline fork: add setterCallbackMap tracking, expose
 callback analyzer

- AbstractCallbackAnalyzer: add public setterCallbackMap field and getter,
  populated during analyzeMethodForCallbackRegistrations.
- SetupApplication: add public callbackAnalyzer field, store it after
  analyzer construction, expose via getCallbackAnalyzer(); add public
  getCallbackMethods() getter.
- Bump version to 2.10.0-mandoline across all modules.

These were all present in the vendored Mandoline/libs trunk jars but
never merged upstream. Porting them forward resolves the runtime
classpath conflict between modern Soot 4.3.0 and the old vendored
FlowDroid that blocked the Android instrumentation pipeline.
